@obverse
1. 1(u) 2(disz) 1/3(disz) gin2 e2 du3-[a] 
#tr.en: One built house plot of 12 1/3 shekels
2. da e2 sza-ma-a-a-tum# 
#tr.en: adjoining the house of Šamatum,
3. e2 hu-mu-ru-um dumu ta#-ri-bu-um 
#tr.en: the house is of Ḫumurrum son of Tarībum;
4. 1/3(disz) sar e2 du3#-[a] 
#tr.en: one built house plot of 1/3 SAR
5. da e2 hu-mu#-ru-um 
#tr.en: adjoining the house of Ḫumurrum,
6. e2 ib-bi-{d}utu dumu lu2-ur-sag-e-ne 
#tr.en: the house is of Ibbi-šamaš son of Ku-ursaggene;
7. e2 e2-e-gen7-nam 
#tr.en: one house is like the other house,
8. lu2 lu2-u3-ra in-szi-in-gar 
#tr.en: one man to the other man has given.
9. u4 kur2-sze3 lu2 lu2-u3-ra 
#tr.en: That in future one against the other
@reverse 
1. inim nu-ga2-ga2-a 
#tr.en: wouldn't bring a claim
