#tr.en: Before Dagan-manšum, son of Enlil-luti;
4. igi ri-ba-tum dumu ku3-{d}inanna 
#tr.en: before Ribatum, son of Ku-inanna;
5. igi {d}suen-im-gur-ra-an-ni dumu i3-li2-[x]-x 
#tr.en: before Sîn-imguranni, son of Ili...;
6. igi im-gur-{d}utu dumu la-a-lum 
#tr.en: before Imgur-šamaš, son of Lālûm;
7. igi i-di-szum bur-gul 
#tr.en: before Idišum, stone-cutter;

8. igi {d}nin-urta-ga-mil dub-sar 
#tr.en: before Ninurta-gāmil, the scribe.
9. iti kin-{d}inanna 
#tr.en: The month of Elūnum,
10. mu sa-am-su-i-lu-na lugal {d}utu {d}marduk-e-ne-bi-da-ra? 
#tr.en: the year in which Samsu-iluna the king, for Šamaš and Marduk (brought into Ebabbar in front of Šamaš and into Esagila in front of Marduk, images praying).
